    "detailed_description": "Gobbo's Gambit is a stealth action game about a sentient NPC that decides he no longer wants to perform his minion duties. He must think with his mind as he navigates the treacherous dungeon he once guarded.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJump, climb, crawl, push and knock enemies unconscious in this fantasy dungeon extravaganza! Players must meticulously outsmart their foes, or succumb to their brute force power. Can you escape the dungeon?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game includes:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Beautiful 3D Fantasy dungeons<br />\r\n-Fully immersive character animation<br />\r\n-Strategic stealth gameplay<br />\r\n-2 full levels of awesomeness!",
